{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38916","headline":"山中对雪有作 · 杜荀鹤","name":"山中对雪有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一浑乾坤万象收，唯应不壅大江流。\n虎狼遇猎难藏迹，松柏因风易举头。\n玉帐英雄携妓赏，山村鸟雀共民愁。\n岂堪久蔽苍苍色，须放三光照九州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}